{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018yyAix4i3sNWaV8YxYw62C","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Vendor Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n2\t\n3\t## VEN-1 Prohibited vendors\n4\tA purchase from a prohibited vendor **must not proceed** without written compliance-officer authorization. Emergency status alone does not change this prohibition.\n5\t\n6\t## VEN-2 Exception authorization\n7\tA specific written authorization by the compliance officer permits use of an otherwise prohibited vendor for the approved transaction. No such authorization may be inferred from manager or finance approval.\n8\t\n9\t## VEN-3 Approved vendors\n10\tAn approved vendor is one designated approved in the transaction facts. The question set explicitly identifies vendor status when relevant.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c251554-6988-4c12-a835-067c61e06965","uuid":"900be01d-d9a1-43a6-bf54-e6388322c573","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:45:52.430Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\mmazu\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-mmazu-Dropbox-00-Claude-Code-Folder-ICM-COP-14-Astra\\56d6a35c-a554-4ec4-9655-eb29c3bbf28d\\scratchpad\\stage4\\DH3-H5\\reference\\04-vendor-policy.md","content":"# Vendor Policy — Fictional Meridian Works (MW)\n\n## VEN-1 Prohibited vendors\nA purchase from a prohibited vendor **must not proceed** without written compliance-officer authorization. Emergency status alone does not change this prohibition.\n\n## VEN-2 Exception authorization\nA specific written authorization by the compliance officer permits use of an otherwise prohibited vendor for the approved transaction. No such authorization may be inferred from manager or finance approval.\n\n## VEN-3 Approved vendors\nAn approved vendor is one designated approved in the transaction facts. The question set explicitly identifies vendor status when relevant.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfxgV3wWFDw5v1ALsej9Y","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**You only need manager approval, and you need it before the purchase.** Finance approval is not required.\n\nThe date is what decides this. June 30, 2025 is one day before the threshold changed, so the older rule applies:\n\n- **The older rule (AMD-1, `reference/05-policy-amendments.md:4`):** Before July 1, 2025, a routine purchase of **$2,000 or less** needed manager approval only. Finance approval was added only for purchases **above** $2,000.\n- **\"Or less\" includes the limit itself (EXP-4, `reference/01-expense-policy.md:14`):** The total counts taxes and fees, so a total of exactly $2,000 falls in the manager-only tier.\n- **The $2,500 limit doesn't apply here (AMD-2, `reference/05-policy-amendments.md:7`):** It started on July 1, 2025 and does not reach back to earlier dates. DEF-3 says the Amendments Policy controls which limit applies to a given transaction date.\n- **\"Before\" means before the purchase (EXP-1 and DEF-2):** The approval has to come before the transaction goes ahead.\n\nUnder either limit, $2,000 needs only manager approval. The date matters because if the total were even slightly above $2,000, say $2,000.01, a June 30 transaction would also need finance approval.\n\n**One condition:** this assumes the vendor isn't on the prohibited list. If it is, the purchase also needs written authorization from the compliance officer before it can go ahead (VEN-1). Manager approval doesn't replace that. Since this isn't travel or an emergency, those policies don't apply."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":519,"cache_read_input_tokens":8326,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":519},"output_tokens":531,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c251554-6988-4c12-a835-067c61e06965","uuid":"a6d0f973-aa3b-4f8f-b107-699bda2da99d","timestamp":"2026-10-12T16:45:58.850Z","request_id":"req_011CfxgV3fPvPuK5CSdS1NZ9"}
